'''Primitive Souls''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Depths of My Heart]]. [[Dogumaru (Enemy)|Dogumaru]] resides here and can be unlocked as a [[Dogumaru (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]] at a 30% chance when beating the stage (guaranteed if a Treasure Radar is used). This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

